  abstract  = "Publisher Summary Emotion is central to the structure and
               processes of personality and the conflicts and crises that
               accompany personality development. Establishing the links
               between emotion and personality offers great promise for the
               studies of personality and emotion---such research points to the
               social and biological mechanisms underlying the structure and
